OutlookMeetJoin

The native loader (src/loader/OutlookMeetJoin.cpp) is a modified version of
OutlookAdFix.cpp from https://github.com/alex94we/outlook-ads-remover (GPL-3.0),
which follows the technique of https://github.com/valinet/NewOutlookPatcher (GPL-3.0).

Changes: own data directory and log, UTF-8 log, no limit on hooked controllers,
skip unknown handler vtables instead of calling a foreign original, optional
DevTools debug flag, truncating log formatting.

